      "en": "Multistage treatment of water, waste water or sewage<br><br><u>NOTE</u><br><br>This group covers combined treatment operations, carried out in a defined order in three or more different treatment stages, each stage occurring in a separate location, e.g. apparatus, reactor or compartment.<br>This group does not cover treatments where the essential characteristic resides in an individual step of the treatment, which treatments are covered by groups C02F1/00 - C02F7/00.",
